    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Relace is a small API only family with two versions, Relace Apply 3 and the newer Relace Search. Both take text in and return text out, both offer a 256000 token context window and up to 128000 tokens of output, and neither supports reasoning or publishes open weights. Pricing is modest per million tokens, from $0.85 input and $1.25 output on Apply 3 to $1 input and $3 output on Search. The facts suggest the family suits long document or code editing and search style tasks where a large context and long outputs matter more than step by step reasoning. Limits are clear, there is no reasoning mode, no open weights, and no image or audio input, and the newer Search version costs noticeably more on output.",
